@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
!include _style.iuml
[*] --> NotInstalled
NotInstalled --> CheckingRoom : user starts download\n(onboarding / Settings)
CheckingRoom --> NotInstalled : free space < model + 500 MB\n(ONRQ-14)
CheckingRoom --> Downloading : enough space (Wi-Fi default)
Downloading --> Downloading : resume from last byte\n(after network loss)
Downloading --> Failed : 3 consecutive failures
Failed --> Downloading : Retry
Downloading --> Verifying : all bytes received
Verifying --> NotInstalled : SHA-256 mismatch\n(file deleted, never loaded)
Verifying --> Installed : checksum OK\n(excluded from backup)
Installed --> Loaded : first inference\n(memory budget <= 60 % RAM)
Loaded --> Installed : app backgrounded /\nmemory warning (unload)
Installed --> NotInstalled : delete model /\nDelete all (PR-10)
note right of NotInstalled
  Not used at all when Apple Foundation
  Models is the selected engine (PR-9).
  Prototype: simulated ~4 s download
  writing a marker file.
end note
@enduml
